.TH DISK_WRITER.PY 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-downtime-logger 0.1.0" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
disk_writer.py \- disk\-activity test producer for the DiskActivityDetector
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python \-m tools.disk_writer
.B \-\-path
.I DIR
.RB [ \-\-interval
.IR SECS ]
.RB [ \-\-filename
.IR NAME ]
.RB [ \-\-once ]
.br
.B python tools/disk_writer.py
.I ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Diagnostic tool shipped with
.BR mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger (1).
It creates
.I DIR
(with parents) if needed, then on every interval appends the current Unix
time to
.IR DIR / NAME
and sets its modification time to now.
Each append is a filesystem modify event for the detector's
.B watchdog
observer, so a
.B DiskActivityDetector
watching
.I DIR
(or a parent, with
.BR recursive: " true)"
stays UP while the tool runs.
.PP
The file grows by one line per interval and is never truncated.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-path " DIR"
Directory to write into.
Required.
.TP
.BI \-\-interval " SECS"
Seconds between writes.
Default
.BR 5.0 .
Keep it below the detector's
.BR idle_seconds .
.TP
.BI \-\-filename " NAME"
File to append to inside
.IR DIR .
Default
.BR .heartbeat .
.TP
.B \-\-once
Write once and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.IR DIR /.heartbeat
Default target file.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
.B \-\-once
completed.
.TP
.B 1
The directory or file cannot be created or written.
.TP
.B 2
Usage error, including a missing
.BR \-\-path .
.TP
.B 130
Interrupted with Ctrl\-C.
.SH EXAMPLES
Keep the
.I local.yaml
disk detector UP:
.PP
.RS
.nf
python \-m tools.disk_writer \-\-path /tmp/daq\-test \-\-interval 5
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger (1),
.BR log_writer.py (1),
.BR mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger.yaml (5)
.SH AUTHOR
Andrew Norman and the Mu2e DAQ group, Fermi National Accelerator Laboratory.
